sourceText:
•	Biotest is intend to launch its new IVIG (IGG next gen) in the Fantaland market.
Marketing Insights give a short executive summary of the main evolutionary scenarios into the country:

1.	a progressive increase of the newborns PID rate population due to continuous ageing;
2.	a progressive increase of the female population with SID;
3.	accelerating spread of digital technologies for telemedicine, which allows remote connections to follow (from hospitals and specialized centers) the therapies provided to the patients;
4.	growth high spending families in the bigger cities;
5.	progressive cut in health expenditure by the state;
6.	legislative trend, at the European level, towards the regulation of home activities with a demand for ad hoc professional qualifications for the performance of health-related assistance services;
7.	an introduction in the market of a growing number of intelligent devices, which are able to allow patients to self-administer, in a very simple way, therapeutic treatments for recurring use;
8.	the approval of a series of regulations aimed at reducing the costs of hospital facilities and favoring, wherever possible, the therapies provided in the patients' homes.

